{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01766LGwXSCrJYohmxTsCDv7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## First action\n2\t\n3\tBefore anything else, invoke your operating contract:\n4\t\n5\t    Skill(skill=\"spacedock:ensign\")\n6\t\n7\tThis loads the shared ensign discipline (stage-report format, background-task polling, worktree ownership, completion signal protocol). The call is safe to call more than once; if the agent-definition preload ever starts working, calling it again is a no-op (the skill content is re-loaded but has no behavioral effect). Do not paraphrase; call the tool.\n8\t\n9\tYou are working on: Auto Continue Task\n10\t\n11\tStage: validation\n12\t\n13\tYour working directory is /tmp/TestLiveCommonAutoContinueAfterImplementation605416176/003/.worktrees/spacedock-ensign-auto-continue-task\n14\tAll file reads and writes MUST use paths under /tmp/TestLiveCommonAutoContinueAfterImplementation605416176/003/.worktrees/spacedock-ensign-auto-continue-task.\n15\tYour git branch is spacedock-ensign/auto-continue-task. All commits MUST be on this branch. Do NOT switch branches or commit to main.\n16\t\n17\tRead the entity file at /tmp/TestLiveCommonAutoContinueAfterImplementation605416176/003/.worktrees/spacedock-ensign-auto-continue-task/auto-continue-task.md for the full spec. It contains:\n18\t\n19\t### Completion checklist\n20\t\n21\tVerify the implementation against AC-1 (the deliverable exists and is committed)\n22\tAppend a `## Stage Report: validation` section with one `- DONE:` item and a PASSED or REJECTED recommendation\n23\t\n24\t### Summary\n25\t{brief description of what was accomplished}\n26\t\n27\t### Fetch commands\n28\t\n29\t    /tmp/TestLiveCommonAutoContinueAfterImplementation605416176/001/spacedock dispatch show-stage-def --workflow-dir /tmp/TestLiveCommonAutoContinueAfterImplementation605416176/003 --stage validation"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AUWaNAc2yMUTtwDXyXeAMB","session_id":"7e61f67c-dbd6-4290